      "reason": "Land cells carry the 1e20 missing value, which would dominate the means and RMSE if not masked.",
      "status": "summary_fallback",
      "fallback": "the notes failed the check",
      "violations": [
        "`um` is not in the selected fragments or the question"
      ],
      "rejected_notes": [
        "Use NaN-aware reductions with weights masked to valid cells. A hand-rolled `(data*weights).sum('time')/weights.sum()` turns land into 0.0, so use `temporal_aggregate` for the 1971–2000 climatology. Any value near 1e20 is an unmasked fill value, not a result."
      ]
